    <briefdescription>
<para>Two-phase commit coordinator with WAL-based crash recovery. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Extends the base 2PC coordinator with a durable write-ahead log so that in-doubt transactions survive coordinator crashes. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
